upjet dynamicValueConversion wraps DynamicPseudoType attributes in a
{"type": ..., "value": ...} envelope. Terraform/OpenTofu requires that
envelope inside terraform.tfstate, but main.tf.json is HCL JSON configuration
where the envelope is parsed as a literal 2-field object instead of the value,
causing Cloudflare zone_setting Update to send {"value":{"type":...,"value":...}}
and fail with 400 Invalid value for zone setting.

Keep main.tf.json parameters free of dynamicValueConversion and apply
dynamicValueConversion only when synthesizing terraform.tfstate in EnsureTFState.

